1. **`flutter_app/lib/services/backup_exclusion.dart`** — the Dart side: `Future<void> excludePathFromBackup(String path)` — no-op unless iOS, calls `MethodChannel('fah/icloud')` `excludeFromBackup {path}`, catches MissingPluginException/PlatformException with an AppLog warning. Plus `@visibleForTesting` injectable hook for tests.

